OL,5,G1800 The Deb Grant Funk and Soul Show
OL,6,     FThis week's Trunk of Funk comes
OL,7,     Ffrom Manchester collective The
OL,8,     F7:45s. Led by songwriter, bassist
OL,9,     Fand guitarist Sam Flynn, they take
OL,10,     Ftheir cue from the great soul
OL,11,     Fhouse bands.
OL,12,G2100 Don Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,13,     FDon's Saturday night selections
OL,14,     Fcross time, space and genre.
OL,15,     FExpect key cuts from the likes of
OL,16,     FAldo Vanucci, Nia Archives,
OL,17,     FFunkadelic, Killing Joke, Jungle
OL,18,     Fand Cocteau Twins.
